     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "genitalia — females: inspection for SMR (pelvic exam only if clinically warranted); males: inspection + testicular palpation for SMR and for hydrocele/hernia/varicocele/mass."
