      "text": "Typical age context [SMR]"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (median US ages): girls' breast stage 2 ~9.5–10.4 y, pubic hair 2 ~9.4–10.6 y; boys' genital stage 2 ~9.5–10.4 y, pubic hair 2 ~11.2–12.3 y (varies by race/ethnicity)."
     }
